WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.670
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:34.100
The banquet cooking battle against
the Dark Cooking Society.

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:34.980
The second round.

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:37.430
The steamed bun contest

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:39.030
between the Pastry King Luogen and Chef Xie,

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:41.570
Number One Dim Sum Chef on the continent begins.

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:43.990
Now they’ve both finished.

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:46.820
The steamed buns made by chefs

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:47.560
of high self-esteem.

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:49.580
This is...

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:53.570
Super Dim Sum Battle!

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.000
The Ultimate Decision!

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:11.130
That’s amazing.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:13.200
I've never seen buns like that.

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:14.300
This is truly a fierce battle

00:02:14.350 --> 00:02:16.780
deciding who is the Number One Dim Sum Chef
on the continent.

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:18.980
Look, guys.

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:20.860
There are colorful buns

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:22.210
filled in the boat!

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:26.320
And the shining golden buns

00:02:26.530 --> 00:02:27.480
on the dragon’s back.

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:29.750
It’s dazzling!

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:33.020
What a battle across centuries.

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:44.650
You’re great! Xie!

00:02:45.070 --> 00:02:46.550
You made the awesome golden buns!

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:49.710
Wait and see. The show has just begun.

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:52.660
That geezer’s buns

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:54.340
are just skin deep.

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:55.880
But my buns are different.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:01.300
Young man.

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:03.690
It’s your buns that just look good.

00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:05.680
Underestimating the best buns

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:08.180
in Chinese dim sum history,

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:09.580
you will regret it.

00:03:10.610 --> 00:03:12.130
Now start tasting.

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.310
First, the Pastry King Luogen.

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:31.960
That’s it.

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:33.450
He cut bamboos

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:36.110
to make this boat-shaped steamer.

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:37.950
What's this?

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:41.500
(White Tiger, Azure Dragon, Red Phoenix)
Mao, look. The four-color buns!

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:43.420
What are the different words on them?

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.150
I have no idea.

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.510
Perhaps just for decoration.

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:48.410
That is...

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:50.810
Do you know it, Lei En?

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:56.420
Like the dim sums

00:03:56.470 --> 00:03:57.480
made by Bailuo’s ancestors

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.800
which soothed the fallen soldiers’ soul,

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:02.690
and pacified the raging river

00:04:02.740 --> 00:04:04.870
that stopped Zhuge Kongming.

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:07.590
The philosophy of Bailuo’s dim sum

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:09.610
is to soothe the soul.

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:15.520
These four-colored buns

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:18.570
are the essence

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:21.300
of Bailuo family’s soul-soothing technique,

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:22.740
the secret of secrets,

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:24.030
with the Four Gods’ Ideal Topography.

00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:25.520
The Four Gods’ Ideal Topography?

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:26.880
What’s the Four Gods’ Ideal Topography?

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:28.920
The Four Gods’ Ideal Topography?

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:30.850
What is that?

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:32.980
The words are separately

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:34.020
Black Tortoise,

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:34.800
Vermillion Bird,

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:35.700
Azure Dragon,

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:36.920
and White Tiger.

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:40.080
They are the four divine beasts
protecting the four directions.

00:04:41.430 --> 00:04:43.940
The topography of these four gods

00:04:44.310 --> 00:04:46.340
is best to pacify turbulence.

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:49.100
(Four God’s Ideal Topography)
Namely, the four directions of the greatest power.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:51.000
That’s right.

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:53.550
Green buns made from spinach

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:54.560
(Azure Dragon)
represent Azure Dragon,

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:56.150
(East)
the east.

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:58.140
Black buns made from black sesame,

00:04:58.190 --> 00:04:59.400
(Black Tortoise North)
Black Tortoise, the north.

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:01.370
Red buns made from carrots,

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:02.470
(Vermillion Bird South)
Vermillion Bird, the south.

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:04.590
(White Tiger West)
White buns, White Tiger, the west.

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:07.740
The four divine beasts are protecting the four directions.

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:09.080
They

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:10.730
are able to pacify the raging waves

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:12.470
and ease people’s minds.

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:14.380
This is the sacred tribute,

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:15.520
the Soul-Repose Buns.

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:16.520
(Soul-Repose Buns)

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:18.950
The Pastry King’s buns still

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:20.940
adhere to the soul-repose principle.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.680
So, these are the legendary buns

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:25.840
of the Bailuo family.

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:27.880
It's rare to taste them.

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:29.180
Let me try it.

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:45.340
Their expressions...

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:48.460
Is it good or not?

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:55.990
The skin is as soft as cotton.

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:57.070
When you take a bite,

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.270
the juice oozes out.

00:05:58.610 --> 00:06:00.450
The texture and tenderness are perfect.

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:03.190
This is...

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:04.120
What?

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:05.060
What’s the stuffing?

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:06.220
Sea cucumbers.

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:07.600
He soaked

00:06:08.070 --> 00:06:08.820
the dry cucumbers so well

00:06:08.870 --> 00:06:09.910
in such a short time.

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:12.420
Mine is the shark fin.

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:14.080
The fusion of shark fin and top juice

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:16.250
offers a vivid taste.

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:18.240
Shark fin as well?

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:26.180
The abalone is so refreshing and soft,

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:28.860
with the pleasant aura of the bamboo boat.

00:06:29.390 --> 00:06:31.680
What an enjoyment.

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:33.900
Scallops.

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:36.100
This... This is crab meat.

00:06:37.570 --> 00:06:39.900
Sea cucumber, shark fin, abalone...

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:43.520
Right! Luogen’s stuffing is...

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:46.460
The Eight Top Seafood Ingredients.

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:49.500
What are the Eight Top Seafood Ingredients?

00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:51.710
Of all the seafood ingredients,

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:53.670
they are the top eight.

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:58.090
Shark fin, abalone, sea cucumber, scallop,

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:02.520
crab, lobster, squid, and flounder.

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:04.060
The Top Eight Seafood Ingredients.

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:09.140
The taste of the top ingredients

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:11.060
are wrapped in the perfect bun skins.

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:12.910
All the eight ingredients

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:14.570
were cooked

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:16.030
in the most proper way.

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:18.930
The most proper way?

00:07:19.050 --> 00:07:19.850
I see.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:22.110
That’s why he used

00:07:22.410 --> 00:07:23.940
the eight casseroles

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.660
for even and mild heating.

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:30.840
Right!

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:38.660
Both my body and soul are in peace now.

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:41.210
I feel so peaceful and comfortable.

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:42.490
This is a treasure.

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:45.170
This is a treasure of buns.

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:52.270
Look at the judges.

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:53.730
They enjoy it so much.

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:56.020
I’ve never seen

00:07:56.110 --> 00:07:57.310
satisfying expressions like that.

00:07:57.800 --> 00:08:00.060
The leaders of guilds

00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:01.960
are supposed to have tasted

00:08:02.010 --> 00:08:03.670
all kinds of good dishes.

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:06.160
Not to mention the top eight ingredients.

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:09.370
I think

00:08:09.410 --> 00:08:11.180
it’s because of the bun skin.

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:12.550
The bun skin?

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:16.320
Yes.

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:17.880
The exclusive yeast of the Bailuo family

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.520
that passed down

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:21.620
from 1,600 years ago,

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:22.830
the Shuhan Old Dough.

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:25.590
The delicate bun skin

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:27.560
made from the unique yeast

00:08:27.970 --> 00:08:28.940
Is the key to the fascinating taste

00:08:28.990 --> 00:08:31.070
of the eight ingredients.

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:59.130
Xie used steak and the skin he didn’t leaven.

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:01.250
Can he really win?

00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:02.770
I should finally see the legendary buns

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:04.470
with my own eyes.

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:07.460
Pastry King Luogen is really awesome.

00:09:08.220 --> 00:09:11.080
The dim sum family whose ancestors

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:12.960
served Zhuge Kongming.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:15.330
Given the 1600-year-old history,

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:17.920
no one can outdo him.

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:35.740
(East. South. West. North)

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:02.290
Four colors represent the four gods.

00:10:02.340 --> 00:10:04.600
With the ancestral unique yeast,

00:10:05.050 --> 00:10:06.490
the Shuhan Old Dough,

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:08.770
plus the top seafood ingredients.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.990
The buns have the power to calm waves.

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:13.290
These are the unparalleled Soul-Repose Buns

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:14.460
across 1,600 years,

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:16.650
the pride of the Bailuo family.

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:20.790
The Seafood and Eight-treasure Bun.

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:37.210
Who is it?

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:39.990
Who is disrespecting

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:41.480
my Seafood and Eight-treasure Bun?

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:43.410
Stop exaggerating, geezer.

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:44.030
What?

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:49.680
Brat.

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:51.120
What's so funny?

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:52.930
Don’t mistake it, geezer.

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:55.690
The one who is mocking

00:10:56.060 --> 00:10:58.940
your traditions and nonsense

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:05.170
is no others,

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:08.770
but my buns.

00:11:09.950 --> 00:11:11.670
These stupid buns?

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:23.430
They are laughing!

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:25.060
The buns are laughing!

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:26.260
How is it possible?

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:27.330
Right.

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:28.750
The buns are laughing!

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:41.990
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:45.900
What... What is that?

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:47.180
Buns are...

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:48.760
Laughing?

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:49.440
Ridiculous.

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:51.300
How could buns laugh?

00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:51.860
Yes.

00:11:52.320 --> 00:11:54.010
There's really laughter

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:56.050
from the smile-like crack.

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:08.340
What’s going on?

00:12:08.510 --> 00:12:09.950
What dish is that?

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:11.280
What's happening?

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:12.580
What is it?

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:15.820
Be quiet.

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:28.280
You laymen.

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:29.300
The buns must be laughing

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:30.820
for some reason.

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:33.650
The crack on it.

00:12:35.470 --> 00:12:36.810
Two pots.

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:40.160
Strange light on the dragon sculpture.

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:43.650
Stupid.

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:44.760
I thought

00:12:44.810 --> 00:12:46.910
you could do better.

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:48.360
Brat.

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:50.650
Did you fry the buns?

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:55.270
Now start tasting Xie’s buns.

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:23.460
Take a look.

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:25.220
What an interesting bun.

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:27.420
It’s fun,

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:28.880
but it won’t do if the taste is bad.

00:13:29.340 --> 00:13:31.120
Xie made fried buns.

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:32.540
But in that case...

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:34.030
Isn’t it okay, Mao?

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:37.160
After fried in high-temperature oil,

00:13:37.360 --> 00:13:38.400
the most important flavor of the meat

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:40.270
will all leak away

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:42.370
from the crack.

00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:47.040
He is right.

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:50.650
The important gravy is all gone.

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:52.250
Such buns

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:53.740
have nothing left but bun skins.

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:55.000
Young man.

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:56.750
You are just playing tricks

00:13:56.800 --> 00:13:58.520
with some fancy buns.

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:00.840
How dare you

00:14:00.970 --> 00:14:03.310
belittle my legendary buns?

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:04.800
You are overconfident.

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:06.940
Is that so?

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:12.710
It’s hot.

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:13.450
What?

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:15.700
Look over there!

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:22.850
The buns are so juicy.

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:24.380
But they taste so refreshing,

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:25.900
not oily at all.

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:28.060
And the gravy

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:30.230
fits perfectly

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:31.960
with the golden crispy skin.

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:38.100
It’s a brand new feeling.

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:41.690
It’s not just good-looking.

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:44.680
It’s a top snack,

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:47.420
which is delicious and fun.

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:49.170
(Super dim sum)

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:53.530
So hot.

00:14:58.180 --> 00:14:59.260
Delicious.

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:01.130
It's warm.

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:03.370
Judges were pacified

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:05.190
by the Soul-Repose Buns.

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:06.990
Now they become so lively.

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:09.300
Great.

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:10.580
I wanna eat, too.

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:12.540
The super dim sum.

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:15.730
How did Chef Xie make them?

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:16.420
No way.

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:17.560
There shouldn’t be

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:19.910
any gravy left in the buns!

00:15:20.510 --> 00:15:22.250
Please open the buns

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:23.790
and look inside.

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:29.570
This... This is...

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:35.740
It is vermicelli!

00:15:36.710 --> 00:15:37.540
Exactly.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:40.130
To make the buns more refreshing,

00:15:40.590 --> 00:15:42.510
I used vermicelli

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.000
to absorb all the gravy.

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:44.860
Right!

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:47.140
So you used steak

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:48.480
to keep the original taste.

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:50.430
If it were minced,

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:51.790
the flavor

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:53.960
would all leak out.

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:55.010
That’s it.

00:15:56.480 --> 00:15:57.420
Super Chef indeed.

00:15:57.540 --> 00:15:58.800
The steak was roasted

00:15:58.850 --> 00:15:59.750
before being diced

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:01.280
to seal the flavor inside.

00:16:01.860 --> 00:16:04.340
Then it was diced and wrapped in the buns.

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:07.090
Got it, geezer?

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:13.000
Awesome, Chef Xie!

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:15.590
Why are they golden?

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:17.610
The egg yolk, I guess.

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:19.300
You are right.

00:16:20.590 --> 00:16:22.300
Apply egg yolk on the skin before frying.

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:24.530
It will look golden in color

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:25.840
and taste better in flavor.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:27.940
That’s the knack of frying buns.

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:36.010
Brat. One last question for you.

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:36.720
Why?

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:38.480
Why are the buns laughing, right?

00:16:42.440 --> 00:16:43.330
Good question.

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:46.210
Listen, Pastry King.

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:48.410
It didn’t crack by itself.

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:49.660
It was cut.

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:51.900
At the beginning,

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:53.680
I cut a small opening on the buns.

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:56.260
The dough was flat

00:16:56.590 --> 00:16:57.010
because I used sodium bicarbonate,

00:16:57.060 --> 00:16:58.680
the baking powder,

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:00.730
which only works with heat.

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:03.140
The sodium bicarbonate will expand fast

00:17:03.190 --> 00:17:04.860
under heat

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:06.460
and make the cracks on the buns.

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:10.770
That’s why it laughs.

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:11.780
That is...

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:13.970
The lightened meet cube

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:15.010
after the juice was drained.

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:16.740
Meet cubes?

00:17:17.110 --> 00:17:19.150
How could the cubes laugh?

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:21.360
I got it, Chef Xie.

00:17:21.900 --> 00:17:23.720
What? You already know it?

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:25.040
You are good.

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:26.420
Tell us now.

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:28.040
Yes. Say it.

00:17:33.020 --> 00:17:35.720
The oil seeped in from the crack

00:17:36.350 --> 00:17:37.090
sealed the cubes,

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:38.860
as well as the interior wall of the bun skin

00:17:39.270 --> 00:17:40.960
and the outer layer of the vermicelli.

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:42.700
The gravy absorbed by the vermicelli

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:45.280
was fully kept inside.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:47.380
At the time,

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:49.790
the water content in the buns

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:51.210
turned into steam and filled the buns.

00:17:51.260 --> 00:17:52.170
I got it.

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:54.110
The pressure of steam

00:17:54.230 --> 00:17:55.180
opened the crack.

00:17:55.230 --> 00:17:55.790
Right?

00:17:56.230 --> 00:17:57.010
Yes.

00:17:57.630 --> 00:17:59.560
Thanks to the intense steam inside,

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:02.010
the meat cubes were rotating fiercely

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:04.470
like steel balls in bells.

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:05.820
Thus there was laughter

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:07.760
out of the crack.

00:18:12.510 --> 00:18:14.340
This is the Golden Laughing Bun!

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:16.880
(Golden Laughing Bun)
The laughing golden buns.

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:21.090
Laughing golden buns?

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:22.930
You are not being serious.

00:18:25.090 --> 00:18:26.680
I don’t care about your family tradition

00:18:26.730 --> 00:18:27.930
or the soul-repose thing.

00:18:28.340 --> 00:18:29.400
Dim sum shouldn’t be

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:31.750
that serious.

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:34.410
Dim sum should make people

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:36.470
feel happy and relaxed. Right?

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:38.070
It’s not only delicious

00:18:38.120 --> 00:18:39.920
but also fun.

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:41.520
Absolutely.

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:42.730
The buns make me

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:44.870
want to laugh too.

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:46.790
You see, geezer?

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:49.040
Leaders of the guilds are laughing

00:18:49.090 --> 00:18:50.220
like little kids.

00:18:54.130 --> 00:18:56.620
Dim sum should make people happy like that.

00:18:57.090 --> 00:18:57.840
Pastry King.

00:19:03.340 --> 00:19:04.590
Don’t gloat. You punk!

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:05.900
Good job, Chef Xie.

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:08.970
Battle it out with your laughing buns.

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:12.090
Chef Xie is amazing.

00:19:12.430 --> 00:19:13.970
We are gonna take this round.

00:19:14.370 --> 00:19:15.540
My father can be saved too.

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:17.480
Pastry King and Chef Xie.

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:18.990
They are both awesome.

00:19:19.390 --> 00:19:21.100
What a wonderful battle.

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:22.900
The unique buns

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:24.000
that soothe people’s mind.

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:25.520
The top-notch buns.

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:28.900
The exciting buns beyond the limit,

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:30.380
one of a kind.

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:38.520
Now the result will be announced.

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:44.140
The Seafood and Eight-treasure Bun

00:19:44.230 --> 00:19:46.250
made by the Pastry King Luogen.

00:19:46.710 --> 00:19:49.400
And the Golden Laughing Bun made by Chef Xie,

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:51.130
the Number One Dim Sum Chef on the continent.

00:19:51.780 --> 00:19:53.730
Leaders of the guilds.

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:55.180
Announce the result now.

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:56.680
Who on earth will win?

00:19:57.320 --> 00:19:58.250
Why bother comparing?

00:19:58.300 --> 00:19:59.680
Isn’t it obvious?

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:00.710
Judges are so excited

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:02.020
with Xie’s buns.

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:03.670
They will all definitely

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:04.660
vote for Xie.

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:05.960
Once we get two wins,

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:07.660
the cookware will be ours.

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:10.140
It doesn’t look

00:20:10.190 --> 00:20:11.770
so simple as you think.

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:23.310
Are they hesitating about it?

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:26.870
Looks like they can’t forget

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:29.160
the taste of Pastry King’s buns.

00:20:29.690 --> 00:20:31.590
The winner is hard to tell.

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:34.690
Will it be the unique buns of the Pastry King

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:36.300
or Chef Xie’s creative buns

00:20:36.530 --> 00:20:38.570
that make people happy,

00:20:38.860 --> 00:20:40.290
like his unrestrained personality?

00:20:45.670 --> 00:20:46.550
Okay. I’ve made my decision.

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:49.210
I’ve made up my mind.

00:20:50.620 --> 00:20:51.660
What about you?

00:20:51.760 --> 00:20:53.090
Yes.

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:56.280
I’ve decided too. No problem.

00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:58.300
All right.

00:20:59.280 --> 00:20:59.960
Where are you going?

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:03.590
Hold on.

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:04.350
What is he doing?

00:21:05.400 --> 00:21:08.040
Now please announce the result.

00:21:08.230 --> 00:21:09.010
Hey, you...

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:11.880
Please lift the red spoon

00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:12.920
if you vote for Chef Xie,

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:14.990
or white spoon

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:16.690
For the Pastry King.

00:21:21.290 --> 00:21:22.190
Those who vote for

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:23.830
Steal Bar Xie,

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:25.540
please lift your red spoons.

00:21:25.980 --> 00:21:26.450
Please.

00:21:28.770 --> 00:21:30.630
How come?

00:21:32.990 --> 00:21:35.370
No one is lifting a red spoon!

00:21:38.470 --> 00:21:40.080
How come?

00:23:14.976 --> 00:23:16.936
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.906 --> 00:23:19.272
Xie Lu lost,

00:23:19.272 --> 00:23:20.366
and it was a complete defeat.

00:23:20.805 --> 00:23:22.430
In front of our upset eyes,

00:23:22.495 --> 00:23:23.681
Xiang En took off her cloak

00:23:23.735 --> 00:23:25.652
and finally revealed her true identity.

00:23:25.652 --> 00:23:27.431
Oh, my God, underneath that...

00:23:27.431 --> 00:23:28.813
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.070 --> 00:23:30.518
Another Set of Seven-Star Knives!

00:23:30.721 --> 00:23:31.851
Enigmatic Beauty Xiang En

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:33.339
It will definitely be interesting!
